# moby-gstage.manifest - freecam poses for the moby vertex stage readback
# (tests/harness/check_moby_gstage_ab.sh, tools/moby_gstage_ab.py).
#
# One row per pose:  <level>[@variant] | pos=(x, y, z) yaw=Y pitch=P | [start VBL] | [LOD tiers]
#   level  a --skip-to-level name
#   pose   a freecam pose string (the per-tick freecam log format, verbatim)
#   start  the capture VBL (default: the freecam corpus's canonical VBL)
#   tiers  the --lod values captured (default: the harness's --lods)
# and carve-out rows:  carve-out | <class> | <reason>
#
# The freecam corpus's first Sunny Villa row.
sunny_villa | pos=(79168, 34297, 14796) yaw=867 pitch=197
#
carve-out | gpf | Spyro 2 and 3 store the final translation (game_layout.moby.rec_tr_final), so moby_decode_project_body never runs the GPF rescale
carve-out | mirrored | no freecam row draws a record whose rotation has a negative determinant; a mirror-twin row is owed
carve-out | shell | the sphere-shell class (0xAA, the bubble about Sparx under water) needs Spyro under water, which no freecam row reaches; a bk2 row is owed
carve-out | near | no Spyro 3 freecam row puts a moby vertex inside the near plane; the class is engaged on Spyro 2 (icy_speedway)
carve-out | lifted | no Spyro 3 freecam row lifts a record onto the near floor; the class is engaged on Spyro 2 (icy_speedway)
carve-out | shaded | Spyro 2 and 3 have no shaded pass (game_layout.moby.hook_draw_shaded is 0); their second model kind projects through moby_simple_project, outside the stage
carve-out | billboard | Spyro 2 and 3 have no shaded pass (game_layout.moby.hook_draw_shaded is 0)
carve-out | drawscale | Spyro 2 and 3 have no shaded pass (game_layout.moby.hook_draw_shaded is 0)
